WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.540
What the libraries are doing right now - and what we are doing now –

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:17.100
is the beginning of something new: we pay better attention and cooperate more.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:25.340
The libraries and the countries involved in the project, we all share an Arctic history,

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:32.260
and a very tangible physical history.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:39.400
So we know where to begin, and what we can and must do.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:44.600
And I believe this is a beginning.

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:50.160
And I hope the young generation will also help pick up the thread.

